# NO CORRO NADA — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values you need.

# Kit (ConvertKit) v4 API key.
# Enables newsletter signup + double opt-in from the /unite join form.
# Leave blank to skip Kit entirely (signups still hit the Google Form).
# See SETUP.md → "Kit" for how to generate this key and find your form id.
KIT_API_KEY=
